### [acceptance criteria]
[x] Surface renders all web states: trail render + the web `items.length<=1 -> return null`
    collapse + per-crumb link/plain/current + compact `…` middle-collapse — all reproduced
    by BreadcrumbsPresentation and the crumb views; covered by Breadcrumbs.Tests.swift.
    (Breadcrumbs owns no data source — its data is caller-supplied props, exactly like the
